                    <h2 class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".2s">Solar Solutions for Maximum Energy Savings</h2>
                    <p>We established Eco Green Energy Solutions Pvt Ltd (EGES) in 2015 to serve Sri Lanka's emerging solar market with world-class renewable energy solutions for residential, commercial and industrial solar power systems, solar lighting and other customized applications.</p>

                    <p>EGES was registered under the Sustainable Energy Authority of Sri Lanka in 2016. Later that year, we expanded our horizons toward larger projects and EGES was re-launched under new management. EGES entered the megawatt range of projects after winning the bid for a 1 MW solar plant with Ceylon Electricity Board in the Beliatta substation area.</p>

                    <p>In addition to innovative energy solutions, we ensure customer satisfaction through best business practices, creditable technical skills, superior support and sustainable elective partnerships for prompt delivery. Having partnered with world renowned renewable energy brands, we strongly believe in providing, maintaining and exceeding quality product expectations of customers.</p>
